        "headline": "美國空軍處置不符測試飛行員學校需求的3架A-29C Super Tucano 另尋訓練替代方案",
        "summary": "美國空軍已處置愛德華空軍基地測試飛行員學校的3架A-29C，評估認為不符該校需求，正尋找尾旋訓練與任務系統教學替代方案。這批飛機於2024年7月移交愛德華基地；空軍測試中心於2026年10月29日發布意向公告，規劃地面處置及隨叫隨到維護，不含復飛維護，飛機預計不會恢復飛行。",
        "headline_en": "US Air Force Divests Three A-29C Super Tucanos That Did Not Meet Test Pilot School Needs and Seeks Training Alternatives",
        "summary_en": "The U.S. Air Force has divested three A-29C Super Tucanos assigned to the Test Pilot School at Edwards Air Force Base after determining they did not meet the school's requirements, and is seeking alternatives for spin training and mission-systems instruction. The aircraft were transferred to Edwards in July 2024. On Oct. 29, 2026, the Air Force Test Center issued a notice of intent outlining ground handling and on-call maintenance, excluding return-to-flight maintenance; the aircraft are not expected to fly again.",
